00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:31.010
I'll take on both of you at once to keep this short.

00:00:31.010 --> 00:00:34.340
If either of you manages to put a scratch on me...

00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:35.720
Let's see...

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:38.850
I'll do whatever you two want for the whole day.

00:00:39.170 --> 00:00:42.020
But if you can't, you'll have to apologize to each other.

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:57.620
Wanna try again?

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:03.540
Only use your dragon gear when you're prepared to kill.

00:01:03.540 --> 00:01:05.120
Never for just an argument.

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:07.920
